SDL3 3.2.30 changes for the onn box (arm64 bionic, EGL surfaceless + zink, ONNM4 zero-copy present).
Port of 0001 (SDL2 2.30.11) including its later additions; everything is active only when ONNM4 is set.
- offscreen GLES: load EGL on the surfaceless platform (0x31DD) instead of EGL device enumeration
- offscreen GLES: ONNM4 present hook after CreateContext and MakeCurrent; SwapWindow presents into app buffers;
  GetProcAddress hands out a glBindFramebuffer wrapper that remaps FBO 0 to the current app buffer
- offscreen window and display: 1280x720 (the app's buffer size), SetWindowSize keeps it
- disk audio: open the device at 48 kHz S16 stereo (OnnShell's AudioSink format); SDL converts the game's stream
- new sdl_onnm4_present.c/.h: receive 3 dma-buf fds on @onn-m4, import as EGLImage FBOs with a shared depth
  renderbuffer, ack frames over 127.0.0.1:7331
Build note: the shipped library's SONAME must be libSDL3.so (APK libs' verneed entries name that file);
onn-pathb/onnbuild/build-sdl3.sh rewrites it in place after the build.
Apply: cd SDL3-3.2.30 && patch -p1 < this.patch

